/**
 * @defgroup backend Backend
 * @{
 * @brief Backend components of the ArgusAI system
 *
 * The backend of ArgusAI is responsible for:
 * - Processing image and video data
 * - Running AI models for object detection and segmentation
 * - Providing RESTful API endpoints
 * - Managing data storage and retrieval
 *
 * @section backend_components Components
 *
 * @subsection main Main Application
 * The main application (`main.py`) serves as the entry point for the backend server.
 * It handles:
 * - API route definitions
 * - Request processing
 * - Model initialization and management
 * - Response formatting
 *
 * @subsection models AI Models
 * The system supports multiple YOLOv8 models:
 * - YOLOv8n: Lightweight model for basic object detection
 * - YOLOv8n-seg: Lightweight model for instance segmentation
 * - YOLOv8l: Large model for high-accuracy detection
 *
 * @subsection api API Endpoints
 * The backend provides the following RESTful API endpoints:
 * - POST /detect: Process images for object detection
 * - POST /segment: Process images for instance segmentation
 * - GET /models: List available AI models
 * - GET /status: Check system status
 *
 * @subsection requirements Dependencies
 * Key Python dependencies include:
 * - FastAPI: Web framework
 * - Ultralytics: YOLOv8 implementation
 * - OpenCV: Image processing
 * - NumPy: Numerical computations
 *
 * @see main.py
 * @see website2.py
 * @}
 */ 